---
title: Apple Crisp
source: Grandma Schwennesen
---

Preheat oven to 350 F.

Place @apples{10%cups}(peeled, cored, and sliced), @flour{1%tbsp}, @cinnamon{1%tsp}, and @granulated sugar{1%cup} in a #13x9 inch baking dish{}.

Pour @water{1/2%cup} evenly over the apples.

Combine @quick oats{1%cup}, @flour{1%cup}, @brown sugar{1%cup}, @baking powder{1/4%tsp}, @baking soda{1/4%tsp}, and @butter{1/2%cup}(melted) until crumbly, then spread evenly over the apples.

Bake for ~{35-40%minutes}.
